er", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "414203644276507267e41dcb9c0b7cfebf2b7371", "message": "Remove window as instance variable\n\nWindow was repeatedly used as an instance variable.\nNow it will be passed to the GUI objects via draw.", "created_at": "2022-11-14T17:56:45Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0074ae36d00cc3eab429074a31ad5080287f15fd", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2022-11-14T16:47:29Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ca951f930d3a82ce95444b0691cfbc4f7379f57", "message": "Update .gitignore", "created_at": "2022-10-13T19:17:08Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f15274291be69558471646bf537250a003e1ae2", "message": "Refactor interface\n\nCreate the class PlayerGUI which is responsible\nof showing all the things related to the player on the GUI.\n\nI predict these information to be:\n* cards\n* name + chips count (PlayerInfoGUI)\n* various objects in front of the player (such as the D disk)\n* bet chips + value\n\nThese objects are kept globally in the interface\nand are rebuilt at the beginning of each play.\n\nObjects in the PlayerGUIs that must be updated\nduring a single play (PlayerInfos and, in the future, the bet) are\nupdated using update methods in the PlayerGUI.", "created_at": "2022-10-04T19:58:25Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a5e61162f3db585cf75cd60935af2be1265b8663", "message": "Refactor interface\n\nMove single components inside\ngui.components.py.\n\nStart interface refactoring.", "created_at": "2022-09-26T16:47:36Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d751c57f70826be9fef4b5ee7683bef90544c5dc", "message": "Check and document game.py", "created_at": "2022-09-26T14:22:22Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a19266961f688502f8fbf040ffb7950c36013bc7", "message": "Check and write models docs", "created_at": "2022-09-26T13:09:38Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a83701dc94ada75011ff52edc2869583324bf277", "message": "Solve itnerface bugs", "created_at": "2022-09-26T12:43:09Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cfd994c5bf96270d35b7b3876b0724af7f92b475", "message": "Finish restore after accidental deletion", "created_at": "2022-09-25T21:48:46Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c939dfea49b127ae2d1bf0c351bc96716b1673d8", "message": "Update game.py", "created_at": "2022-09-25T21:41:31Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf32d2d7b2280ac31cd8a91c8bd206af2a6ac97e", "message": "Restore a lost commit", "created_at": "2022-09-25T21:40:08Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c8300d6fe84f0ca1d3b4046ae8918c9fc751eb8f", "message": "Pygame interface integration\n\nThe integration is not complete and could present bugs.", "created_at": "2022-09-23T16:16:27Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19645d5ce00711d35b6c67e459e8cd5c987df50e", "message": "Black", "created_at": "2022-09-23T12:19:03Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e05cf22f74b0e34412ca3c55154e58039e8fd84", "message": "Implement multiple pots\n\nSolve different bugs.", "created_at": "2022-09-23T11:15:46Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a992b6063f871917d40fd3a791dedfa6471b717", "message": "Implement winners check\n\nImplement winners check and integration with game.\nThe game seems to work, but all-ins and multiple pots must\nbe added before starting with the\ninterface.", "created_at": "2022-09-22T20:48:38Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "11bf67aa74e603a026e98414a2347f39b4a7f52d", "message": "Add check for One Pair\n\nImplement function to get high\ncards in order.", "created_at": "2022-09-22T18:52:04Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5735dee40a1dfc7394aa4ebeab39f1d452816134", "message": "Implement and test check for Two Pair", "created_at": "2022-09-22T17:39:08Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3be61f5007742401f4bc9aa41cb9aedf23db1cee", "message": "Implement and test check for Three Of A Kind", "created_at": "2022-09-22T16:36:36Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e08f2f5eb058c804d683326dd77e2eafd66cd5c2", "message": "Black", "created_at": "2022-09-22T16:10:23Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ac47188ed1d028ce4980c016726a8e1038b2e17", "message": "Implement flush and straight checks", "created_at": "2022-09-22T16:09:04Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a53e1317822b709b23c1642471b5e802f41b723f", "message": "Implement and test Full House check", "created_at": "2022-09-22T15:24:21Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24b989c1db00764ddcfda6580c1ade8a81a6052d", "message": "Add check for Four Of A Kind\n\nAdd check and test.\n\nAdd Rank enum instead of integers\nfor expressing the rank of a card: more expressivity.\n\nGive new value to Ace as the most\nvaluable card.\n\nAdd ordering relationship among\nsuits for reproducibility of results (useful for testing).", "created_at": "2022-09-22T14:27:30Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49de837334829280252d6440cfaf55329360d3c9", "message": "Change checkers format\n\nThe format of the hands checker changes.\nAn hand checker returns the hand in an ordered\nlist where the first card is the strongest card\nof the hand (and so on, as the hand are explained\non any website).\nThis makes it possible to compare different hands\nwith the kickers.\n\nNone is returned if the hand is not present.", "created_at": "2022-09-22T08:08:35Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0564c6ab30706257a5e0c63abf9afb85eed0b84c", "message": "Generate requirements", "created_at": "2022-09-21T22:17:19Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cbe0aab32f7ba4e1e74530d3f5ffa0a933f3c16c", "message": "Setup pytest\n\nSetup pytest and write first test for hands_checker module.", "created_at": "2022-09-21T22:16:19Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cbe6b8406e93eaa42e5d1b46df626bf5c936c438", "message": "Start creation of checks for endplay\n\nCreate the hands_checker module dedicated to hand\nrankings checks to use at the end\nof a play.\n\nImplement check for straight flush.", "created_at": "2022-09-21T20:36:16Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8195fb27bcb0b00e3a27ec47a083efedae11afc7", "message": "Update .gitignore", "created_at": "2022-09-21T20:34:26Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2738b4c47dd46251729e43a156566f5d86f781b5", "message": "Refactor cards dealing process\n\nThe deck becomes responsible for dealing the hands and the\ncommunity cards, which are\nseen as containers.\n\nIn this way it's possible to initialize Hands and Communities\nwithout using a Deck (useful for tests).", "created_at": "2022-09-21T20:31:07Z", "repo": "pyker", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2021-12-22T07:35:26Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2022-12-22T15:11:27Z", "body_length": 113}, {"created_at": "2022-12-18T20:13:36Z", "body_length": 80}, {"created_at": "2022-11-18T10:08:15Z", "body_length": 153}, {"created_at": "2022-11-17T18:21:58Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2022-11-17T18:18:05Z", "body_length": 0}]}